{"title":"Living Sap","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Sapling Treant</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"sapling-treant\" title=\"Sapling Treant - dropped it in 4 of 7 looted corpses (1/1.8)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/1e5337fd4c7c8220dcbc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sapling Treant</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.8<br>×1–2</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"living-sap\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/scribing\">Scribing</a></p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/scroll-hitpoints\">Hitpoints Scroll</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Scribing 5</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/ec8ca9efb112aa596780.svg\" alt=\"Living Sap\"></div><h3>Living Sap</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>1 monster</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>1 recipe</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/23/2026, 9:29:20 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}